text.en:
The following departments, in addition to the Royal Brunei Police Force, are hereby authorised to destroy and impound any dogs found at large without a label or badge for the current year —

(a) the Municipal Boards of Bandar Seri Begawan, Kuala Belait and Seria and Tutong within their respective municipal area;

(b) the District Offices of Brunei and Muara, Tutong, Belait and Temburong.
